Project: DeltaX Website | thesx.co | 6 pages + 404
Stack: Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind v3.4, Framer Motion, Days One + Inter + JetBrains Mono
Design: Leo V2 (DeltaX-Website-Design-V2.md)

ARCHITECTURE:
- Home sections: src/components/home/
- About sections: src/components/about/
- Contact sections: src/components/contact/
- Shared (Navbar, Footer): src/components/shared/
- UI primitives: src/components/ui/
- Data files: src/data/ (team.ts, caseStudies.ts)
- No section imports another section. Only ui/, shared/, and data/.

CODE RULES:
- Named exports only. Never default exports (except page.tsx/layout.tsx).
- "use client" when using hooks, state, or Framer Motion.
- @/ path aliases for all imports.
- Import types from @/types.
- Import team data from @/data/team, case studies from @/data/caseStudies.
- CSS @keyframes for infinite animations. Framer Motion for scroll-triggered.
- Max ~200 lines per component. Split if larger.
- No any types. No console.log. No TODO comments.
- Max font-weight: 600 (semibold). Never bold/700.

COLORS (Tailwind tokens):
bg: primary #0A0A0B | secondary #111116 | tertiary #1A1A22 | elevated #222230 | deep #080809
text: text-hero #FFF | text-body #E8E8E8 | text-secondary #999 | text-muted #666
pillar: core-bright #1A9BBF | code-bright #8A8A8A | scale-bright #D94040 | style-bright #6E75FF
accent: accent-gold #f0b429 (CTAs ONLY — single-accent discipline)

FONTS:
font-display = Days One (headlines — period-terminated ALWAYS)
font-body = Inter (body, UI — max 600 weight)
font-mono = JetBrains Mono (stats, overlines, data — uppercase, tracking 0.08-0.12em)

CTA: "Start a Project" — gold pill button, everywhere. Same text in hero, navbar, final CTA.

COMPONENT RULES:
- Buttons: rounded-full (pill). 3 sizes: large h-[52px], medium h-[44px], small h-[36px].
- Tags/overlines: borderless text. font-mono, uppercase, text-muted. NO backgrounds. NO borders.
- Section overlines: "[NN] SECTION NAME" format (JetBrains Mono, 12px, #666, tracking 0.12em).
- Highlight boxes: 3px left-border ONLY. Never full border. Never background color.
- Data: table rows. NEVER card grids. Header mono uppercase, rows Inter 400.
- Headlines: MUST have text-wrap: balance (via CSS or style prop). letter-spacing: -0.03em display, -0.02em headings. This is enforced in globals.css but verify on custom elements.
- Numbers: MUST use font-mono class (which has tabular-nums via globals.css). All stats, counters, prices = JetBrains Mono.
- Reduced motion: Framer Motion handles this via MotionConfig. CSS animations use @media (prefers-reduced-motion). Low-end devices get body.low-end class (hides ambient effects).
- Section padding: py-24 (mobile) / py-32 (desktop). Container max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6.
- Atmosphere: every section has grid texture + vignette + one pillar glow via SectionWrapper.

DO NOT:
- Use raw hex in className (use Tailwind tokens)
- Use card grids (rejected 4 times — every section has unique layout)
- Use bold/700 weight (max semibold/600)
- Use SVG noise overlays (banned — caused z-index crisis)
- Use glassmorphism on cards (only on navbar-on-scroll)
- Use position: fixed for sections (use sticky or static)
- Create files outside your assigned task
- Modify globals.css, types/index.ts, tailwind.config.ts, or data/ files
- Modify ANYTHING in Docs/ (prompts, knowledge base, roadmap, audits)
- Modify .windsurfrules, .gitignore, package.json, or any config file
- Push to main branch directly (always create your own branch, Arvin merges)
